Everything besides an amulet of reflection would give a Monk some sort
of melee penalty.  An alternate solution would be to gain resistances.
For example, if you had shock resistance, then the wand of lightning
would not have damaged you.

A Monk can get telepathy from praying on an altar.  Alternatively,
there are a few Artifacts you could wish for that give telepathy when
carried (all 3 alignments have such an artifact).

A Monk automatically gets teleport control at experience level 17.

Also, there are rings of "teleportation" and "teleport control".



